A journal without a default commodity warns even when lot cost balances against SEK.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND {{100 SEK}}
  Assets:Cash  -100 SEK

========== WARNINGS ==========

[MISSING_DEFAULT_COMMODITY] Journal must declare one default commodity
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:1:1
